BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (law, service setting, network relationships, and the payment-determination method before calculating an opportunity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (Some self-funded plans can opt into specified state arrangements; some services follow an applicable All-Payer Model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (Agreement. Exclude Medicare and Medicaid inventory from this commercial federal IDR sourcing model and route) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (ordinary contractual disputes elsewhere. The federal mechanism is not a universal underpayment remedy. Record the) Tj ET
