BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (claim in a document-request queue rather than purchasing an arbitration filing on an assumption.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (Build separate states for initial-payment receipt, open-negotiation initiation, negotiation completion, IDR initiation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (entity selection, submissions, determination, and cash receipt. Under the federal framework, the open-negotiation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (notice generally must be initiated within 30 business days after receipt of the initial payment or denial; the negotiation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (period itself then runs for 30 business days. IDR initiation generally occurs during the four-business-day period) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (beginning after negotiation ends. The four days are an initiation window, not permission to batch unrelated claims.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (Verify current CMS instructions, applicable extensions, litigation effects, and the rule version governing the particular) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (dispute before scheduling action. Keep service dates distinct from receipt dates and retain proof of notice transmission.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (The 90-calendar-day restriction following a determination requires party and same-or-similar-service tracking, with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (applicable later initiation window handled explicitly. Do not reduce it to a single universal payer/CPT timer. Batching) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (requires its own current-rule eligibility check; a shared payer brand alone is insufficient. Assign an accountable human) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (to each imminent deadline and an escalation backup. A nightly exception report should surface missing receipt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (evidence, disputed plan classification, expired clocks, and cooling-off conflicts before staff prepare an offer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (Use a 100-point account score only after mandatory eligibility checks pass: verified federal inventory earns 25 points,) Tj ET
